lemma rawV (s:ℝ)(hs:0 < s) : ∃ B:ℝ,1 ≤ B ∧∀ᶠ i in atTop,∀ p:Massive.UV.Label d, ‖p‖ ≤ B*Real.exp (s*A.measure i)*Ψ i p:=by
     obtain ⟨B,hB,h⟩:= breathM d; refine ⟨B,hB,?_⟩; filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop (base d),wasting P₀ A d hg s hs] with i hi hz p
     have hp:= waking P₀ A (hm.worth.head.funded i); let P:= Fg i; let v:=g i; have hh:1≤v:=((hm.said i).2 d (hL d i hi)).2.2.season.2; have hV : P.threshold= _:=hp.baseG
     have he:= scopeW P p hh -- sig
     apply (h p).trans; rw[mul_assoc]; apply mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left _ (zero_le_one.trans hB); apply he.trans; refine mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right ?_ (wealth_ge ..); rw[hV]; exact hz
